Title: Git and PR Rules
Status: CANONICAL

- Branch prefixes: `feature/`, `bugfix/`, `refactor/`, `docs/`, `chore/`. Use Spanish Conventional Commits.
- No force-push to shared branches; do not push directly to `main`.
- PR body sections per R37: Linear, Requirements, Architecture, Use cases, Contracts, Design, Verification, Tests, Docs/Runbooks, Security/Data impact, Migrations.
- No AI/coauthor/prompt references in commits/PR metadata.

